	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Libros, quos petis, censsante cęlo pluvioso fide <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>bona mittam, necdum etiam ex <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> venerunt <persName ref="p3088">Sturmii</persName> libri, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quos tu petis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Belli sane librum ad nundinas mittam; nam quidam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>addit quędam, quo continuata sit historia usque ad nostra tempora.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Alii libelli sunt parvi, quoas omnes accipies brevi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p8073">Gilberti</persName> frater perfert ad te literas, a quo, quę in <placeName>Burgundia</placeName> aguntur, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>fuse scire poteris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Episcopus <placeName>Wiennensis</placeName> Pannoniae <placeName ref="l922">Friburgi Brisgaudiae</placeName> est, quid illic acturus, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dominus novit; est electus in prępositum in <placeName ref="l1020">Waldkilch</placeName>, quem reliqui canonici <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nolunt suscipere, quia alium crearunt; sed <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> rex illum in hanc conditionem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>intrudere conatur votique compos erit absque dubio.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Verum brevi, quid <placeName ref="l922">Friburgi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>egerit, mihi significabitur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>De novo rege <placeName>Maroci</placeName> in <placeName ref="l2549">Africa</placeName> rumores nosti; quem aiunt egregie pergere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>in semel instituto negotio et iam alium regem <persName>Pesian</persName> proflixisse ac in <placeName>Mauritanię</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>fines irrupisse.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Portugalliae rex in armis est novum populum aut perditurus aut omnia <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>amissurus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>In <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName> nobilis quidam iuxta mandatum Caesaris Interim instituit pastoremque <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>pium et doctum deposuit; nomen loci excidit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Interim rusticis suis pompositis verbis additis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>minis proposuit praelegitque neglectoribus pęnam irrogare volens; se cacare in <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> evangelium et doctrinam a Caesare non probatam.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Abitum vero parans insanus fit, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ut nesciret, quidnam ageret.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Volunt illum nobiles alii retinere, sed noluit manere, domi s<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>e pernoctaturum dixit, ne ab hostibus, qui vitę eius insidiarentur, capiatur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Inscenso <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>itaque equo valedixit omnibus; sed mox miser, puto ab angelo dei percussus, in terram <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cadit ac cervicem frangit sicque insanus Interimista praesentem plagam sensit, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>... siqueque videtur cum deo non esse pugnandum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Hęcque est vera historia, quam hausi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ab illo, qui eo die in isto pago fuit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Uxor autem nobilis et consanguinei rogarunt s<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>acerdotem, quem exautoraverat nobilis, quo maneat et officium suum, quo hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>strenue functus fuerat, non derelinquat et pro tota familia oret, ne in similem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>pęnam cadat, in quam audierant nobilem vesanum cecidisse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">An non Interim interem<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>it illum insanum virum?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Primogenitum ducis <persName>Saxonię</persName> captivi filium aufugisse dicunt ad civitates <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>maritimas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">die Hansestädte ("Seestädte").</note>, quarum supremus capitaneus est factus; noluit enim Interim recipere et <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>timuit, ne, cum repugnaret Caesareanis edictis, caperetur ac ad patrem ducereturque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Der bischoff von <placeName ref="l491">Strassburg</placeName> <foreign xml:lang="la">nunc iam quarto legatos ad senatum petens,</foreign> das sy <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>allen predicanten und sonst pfaffenßgnoß den eidt uffgeben und sy im lassen schweren; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>sunst wellen die meßpfaffen nit darin.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Senatus hat ein dilationem genommen biß noch der <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>meß,</foreign> quo commodius possent nundinas celebrare instantes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><foreign xml:lang="de">Die niderlendische stett schweren dem</foreign> filio Caesaris tanquam filio Caesaris <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ic imperium hęreditarium est factum repugnantibus civitatibus et principibus <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>imperii.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nemo audet mutire contra Caesaris edictum, et episcopi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>propter restitutionem rerum externarum etiam tacent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Nosti D. <persName>Granvellam</persName> <foreign xml:lang="de">in allen sinen decken</foreign> aut...</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Sic visum est superis.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Adscripsit quidam: aquilam submittere <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>poteris alludens <foreign xml:lang="de">uff sin</foreign> insigne a Caesare dato; <foreign xml:lang="de">dan er fiert <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>ein seuwkopf uff sim wappen, im wappen ein adler;</foreign> hoc <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>est, <foreign xml:lang="de">die sauw sol den adler regieren.</foreign></s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Et probe, quin <persName>Caesar</persName> dixit <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p7706">Granvellam</persName> esse animam ipsius.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> et <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> et reliquos nomine meo salutabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 30. iunii <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Molo iam scribere de statu nostrę civitatis; nostri enim volunt iurare antiquo more fędus <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Helveticum: <foreign xml:lang="de">das in gott helff und alle heiligen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Dissentiunt pastores.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Tragędiam novam timeo orituram.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">G[astius</persName>] raptim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Vigilantissimo pastori D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> praeceptori, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>suo in domino charissimo.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zur<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
